                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "66c292bb-e9ae-3902-8876-5e969251f924",
                        "entry_id": "0f3bcab7-494f-398e-8598-e1b88ce12a4f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "pressed (caviar)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c48de3ab-b81a-49ad-821a-19bd796dff5e",
                                "sense_id": "66c292bb-e9ae-3902-8876-5e969251f924",
                                "text": "Стёпа, тара́ща глаза́, уви́дел, что на ма́леньком сто́лике сервиро́ван подно́с, на ко́ем име́ется наре́занный бе́лый хлеб, па́юсная икра́ в ва́зочке, бе́лые марино́ванные грибы́ на таре́лочке, что́-то в кастрю́льке и, наконе́ц, во́дка в объёмистом ювели́ршином графи́нчике.",
                                "translation": "Styopa, rolling his eyes, saw that a tray had been set on a small table, on which tray there were sliced white bread, pressed caviar in a little bowl, pickled mushrooms on a dish, something in a saucepan, and, finally, vodka in a roomy decanter belonging to the jeweller’s wife.",
                                "english": "Styopa, rolling his eyes, saw that a tray had been set on a small table, on which tray there were sliced white bread, pressed caviar in a little bowl, pickled mushrooms on a dish, something in a saucepan, and, finally, vodka in a roomy decanter belonging to the jeweller’s wife."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
